    "detailed_description": "You wake up tied to an office chair in the middle of an empty room. A mysterious device with a 10-minute timer is attached to you. Explore the office floors, try not to tip over, and find a way to escape!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281410/extras/7fd3230dcbb097ae7707a8b917838188.poster.avif?t=1755427240\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281410/extras/7fd3230dcbb097ae7707a8b917838188.webm?t=1755427240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281410/extras/7fd3230dcbb097ae7707a8b917838188.mp4?t=1755427240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Physics simulation of an office chair on wheels. Move around the floors, but be careful not to tip over.<br></li><li> The aesthetics of liminal spaces. Explore the floors of the gloomy office building.<br></li><li> Separate control of each of the character's hands.<br></li><li> Retro style, a distinctive feature of the Ells Tales series.<br></li><li> Bonus: ray tracing for owners of modern graphics cards, adding even more depth and atmosphere to the visuals.</li></ul>",
